WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.120
Here in Los Angeles,

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.070
COVID vaccines are being slowly

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:08.160
distributed to people 65 and older.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.030
But according to a recent article,

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.910
some people under 65 in L.A.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:17.170
are still trying to get
the vaccine at any cost.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.291
These people are being
called vaccine chasers.

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:21.550
Yeah.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.530
Now, typically these people
line up at vaccination sites

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.980
for hours, hoping there
might be an extra dose

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.570
available at the end of the day.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.840
Not only that, since this is L.A.,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.370
some of these people are
going as far as sending in

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:39.330
audition tapes to be considered
for early vaccination.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.850
Yeah, we actually got our hands

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:44.710
on some of these vaccine audition tapes.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.460
Yeah, unbelievable, check them out.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.670
Hi, Jocelyn Marks, Stewart Talent,

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.273
and I am auditioning to get a vaccine.

00:00:56.991 --> 00:00:58.981
(gasps)

00:00:58.981 --> 00:01:00.981
(moans)

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:03.460
(groans)

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.730
Hi, I'm Jeff Matthews and I'm
auditioning for the vaccine

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:08.350
with some of my impressions.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:11.773
So you want the vaccine?

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.303
You can't handle the vaccine!

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.620
Hi, Danny Richardson, SAG-eligible.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.550
No, I'm not technically a doctor.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:25.150
I did play one once in
a small, adult film.

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:29.130
Eli Bright, special
skill: stand-up comedy.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.880
You know, men and women
get COVID very differently.

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:36.860
So I actually brought some wigs.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:40.720
They're from my improv
studio before it burnt down.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.380
Oh, this one's cool.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.390
It's kinda like...

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:45.643
No, you know what?

00:01:45.643 --> 00:01:46.990
I'm so sorry.

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:49.840
Slate, hi, my name is
Barry Diesel, no relation.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:53.400
This is my first video audition.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.200
I am a stage combat expert,

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.863
proficient in such styles as punching,

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:00.833
staff work,

00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:03.291
(staff clatters)

00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:04.273
swordplay,

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.483
and throwing a banana in slow motion.

00:02:12.012 --> 00:02:12.930
(banana thuds)

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.700
Hi, I'm Kathy Yamamoto.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.699
Please give me the vaccine.

00:02:16.699 --> 00:02:17.532
(pounding on door)
(child screaming)

00:02:17.532 --> 00:02:19.090
Sorry.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.374
Sorry, I'm doing an audition.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:22.840
[Child] We're hungry!

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:23.840
Can you just keep it down?

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.970
[Child] Mommy, you never feed us!

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:26.920
Roommates. (laughs)

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.446
And I, they let me keep the lab coat,

00:02:29.446 --> 00:02:30.760
which is pretty great, right?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.275
Also I will do nudity.

00:02:32.275 --> 00:02:37.220
Wow, ow, wow!

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:40.275
White people take the vaccine like this.

00:02:40.275 --> 00:02:43.292
Allrighty then.

